    "detailed_description": "<h1>Contact</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/c514daf17eda5904c55db0618c6e6a53.avif?t=1712985868\" width=512 height=128 /></span><br>This game is in the public testing stage and we will actively listen to the opinions of players for improvement and refinement game.<br>If you like this game,please add wishlist!Thank you for your support.</p><br><h1>Update plan</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/09fcc633642ca1112e5e6e90eed5eefe.poster.avif?t=1712985868\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/09fcc633642ca1112e5e6e90eed5eefe.webm?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/09fcc633642ca1112e5e6e90eed5eefe.mp4?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Content update plan:<br>Phase 1: Kunlun Mountain (Snow Mountain) Map Boss and its skills. After defeating them, they can be selected as initial heroes, and the number of available heroes can be increased to 6.<br>Phase 2: Forest and Swamp Map Production and Boss. After defeat, it can be used as an initial hero selection, with an increase of 7 available heroes.<br>Phase 3: Creating a map of the Inferno Volcano and having a boss. After defeating it, it can be used as an initial hero choice, with an additional 8 available heroes.<br>Phase 4: Leichi Map Creation and Boss. After defeat, it can be used as the initial hero selection, and the number of available heroes can be increased to 9.<br>Phase 5: Desert map creation and boss. After defeat, it can be used as the initial hero selection, and the number of available heroes can be increased to 10.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/489a6785a4969d17b360cafe92095c99.poster.avif?t=1712985868\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/489a6785a4969d17b360cafe92095c99.webm?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/489a6785a4969d17b360cafe92095c99.mp4?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Optimize and update content (long-term):<br>1. Regularly update and optimize the hero's various skills based on player feedback.<br>2. Update and optimize the system UI interface based on player feedback.<br>3. Based on player feedback, update and optimize monster attributes and types, improve the frequency and exclusive skills of elite monsters.<br>4. Based on player feedback, update and optimize the basic damage and attributes of each hero.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/4c5b99d10b6524c05b465b57bc8fc554.poster.avif?t=1712985868\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/4c5b99d10b6524c05b465b57bc8fc554.webm?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/4c5b99d10b6524c05b465b57bc8fc554.mp4?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>-You can choose three Easten Immortals become a team from five different heroes(sword, blade, whip, stick, and bow, )<br>-Each Immortals has three exclusive skills and two attribute bonuses.<br>-Each  Immortals has their own unique team bonus.<br>-In the initial game, choose a Immortals to start the game, and as the game progresses, you will encounter other Immortals to fight together.<br>-As the game progresses, you will upgrade to acquire different abilities and skills.<br>-During the game, monsters and bosses will become increasingly powerful, and it is important to keep a distance from them at all times.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/c585faca072c087fee978aee53b0bf09.poster.avif?t=1712985868\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/c585faca072c087fee978aee53b0bf09.webm?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/c585faca072c087fee978aee53b0bf09.mp4?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/4c5b99d10b6524c05b465b57bc8fc554.poster.avif?t=1712985868\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/4c5b99d10b6524c05b465b57bc8fc554.webm?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/4c5b99d10b6524c05b465b57bc8fc554.mp4?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>-You can choose three Easten Immortals become a team from five different heroes(sword, blade, whip, stick, and bow, )<br>-Each Immortals has three exclusive skills and two attribute bonuses.<br>-Each  Immortals has their own unique team bonus.<br>-In the initial game, choose a Immortals to start the game, and as the game progresses, you will encounter other Immortals to fight together.<br>-As the game progresses, you will upgrade to acquire different abilities and skills.<br>-During the game, monsters and bosses will become increasingly powerful, and it is important to keep a distance from them at all times.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/c585faca072c087fee978aee53b0bf09.poster.avif?t=1712985868\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/c585faca072c087fee978aee53b0bf09.webm?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640390/extras/c585faca072c087fee978aee53b0bf09.mp4?t=1712985868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
